修复触发词:
- "修复BUG" / "修复错误" / "Fix Bug"
- "解决问题" / "Solve Issue"

架构触发词:
- "重构" / "Refactor"
- "优化" / "Optimize"
- "架构调整" / "Architecture"
```

### File Operation Triggers (文件操作触发)
```
- Creating any .vue, .ts, .tsx, .cs file
- Modifying files in packages/*
- Modifying files in src/*
```

